Package: grub-settings
Version: 0.1.4
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, libgtk-4-1, libadwaita-1-0
Maintainer: Taylan <taylan@example.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/bingoweb/grub-settings
Description: Modern GRUB bootloader configuration tool
 GRUB Settings is a GTK4/Libadwaita application that provides
 a user-friendly graphical interface for configuring GRUB
 bootloader settings on Linux systems.
 .
 Features:
  - Menu timeout and visibility settings
  - Background image and resolution configuration
  - Default OS and dual-boot settings
  - Kernel parameters (quiet, splash, recovery)
  - Language and theme selection
